VECTORS:
basic syntax: vector<int> v;
              v.pushback();
              v.emplaceback();
as iterator: vector<int>::iterator it = v.begin()
TO PRINT AN ENTIRE VECTOR: for (vector<int>::iterator it = v.begin(); it != v.end(); it++) {
                              cout << *(it) << " ";
                              }

