WHAT IS A SET?? -- everything is sorted and is unique.

## STL Containers
map: ordered key-value, O(log n) ops
unordered_map: hash-based, O(1) avg ops
set: unique sorted elements, O(log n)
unordered_set: hash-based unique elements
priority_queue: max-heap by default
  Use greater<int> for min-heap

multiset: allows duplicates
